  "question": {
    "text": "<p><strong>Statement I :</strong> The law of gravitation holds good for any pair of bodies in the universe.</p><p><strong>Statement II :</strong> The weight of any person becomes zero when the person is at the centre of the earth.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below.</p>",
